  "title": "{J'avais déjà...} - Had Already Done Phrases",
  "description": "Add depth to stories! '{J'avais déjà mangé}' (I had already eaten), '{J'étais déjà parti}' (I had already left). Show what happened FIRST in a story.",
  "teaches": {
    "constructions": [
      "fr:cx:plus-que-parfait.avoir"
    ]
  },
